<title>NEW ZEALAND: Firestone to invest NZ$25 mln in plant.</title>
<headline>Firestone to invest NZ$25 mln in plant.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firestone New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it was restructuring its Christchurch tyre factory, where it planned capital investment of NZ$25 million over five years.  </p>
<p>Jenkins said Firestone was offering a &quot;generous resignation benefit&quot; for any staff who did not wish to switch to the seven-day operation.</p>
<p>Firestone is 83 percent owned by Bridgestone/Firestone Inc . -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
